WEBVTT

00:00:00.548 --> 00:00:08.612
This video shows how to close a month on your phone. Closing a month locks it, so its figures can no longer change.

00:00:10.279 --> 00:00:20.311
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Finance, and choose Accounts. The Close Month button is at the top of the page, on the Balance Summary tab.

00:00:21.136 --> 00:00:28.504
At the end of a month, tap Close Month. A window opens where you choose the month and the year to close.

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:39.148
Read the warning: no transactions can be added or edited in that month after closing. Tap the box that says I understand, close this period.

00:00:40.174 --> 00:00:47.854
Now tap Close Month again. A message says the month is closed, and the page shows the last closed month.

00:00:51.148 --> 00:00:57.268
The month is closed and locked. Only school admins and principals can do this.
